{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959850/extras/f28ff3507d83126f337a9007fd31d53a.avif?t=1768478595\" width=1280 height=171 /></span>Lucian, on what seemed like an ordinary school day, suddenly finds himself trapped in a deserted, post-apocalyptic world. The once lively corridors of his school are now silent and filled with shadows and unknown dangers. Together with Elora, he must rely on cooperation and determination to survive. Players must use both their intelligence and courage to solve puzzles, unlock doors, and uncover hidden paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the constant threat of lurking creatures, every step heightens the tension. Staying silent, moving strategically, and avoiding sudden dangers are key to survival. The immersive atmosphere, detailed environments, and impactful sound design create a truly tense horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Lucian and Elora\u2019s journey is not only about escape \u2014 as dark secrets and mysterious events unfold, players slowly uncover the truth behind this abandoned world. Every choice, every solution, directly affects their chance of survival. This is not just a horror game; it is a story-driven experience that tests wit, strategy, and bravery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling third-person survival horror gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven experience with puzzles and mysteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth and strategy-focused survival mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sound design and tense atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deepening journey of Lucian and Elora</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3959850?t=1768478595","background_raw":"https